<p>Papers will be fully peer-reviewed. If the paper is accepted and presented, it will be included in the conference proceedings. NSTC takes the protection of intellectual property very seriously. All submissions will be screened for plagiarism using Cross Check. By submitting your work you agree to allow NSTC to screen your work for plagiarism.</p>

